{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gb8Suxw6KBJVXVR6e25S2a","type":"tool_result","content":"# ard configuration for albertcbrown/ard (dogfooding). Started from `ard init`'s\n# template; human-owned. ard serve reads it from origin/main.\n# Anything unset takes its built-in default (docs/proposal.md, Configuration).\n# Validate with `ard config check`. ard serve reads this file from origin/main.\n\n# label: only issues a maintainer labels for triage enter the pipeline.\n# all: every human-filed issue enters.\nintake: { mode: label }\n\n# Loop poll intervals. Unset loops keep their defaults (scanners 4h,\n# prwatch 5m); 1m is the minimum. Triage, workers, reviewers and the merger\n# poll every minute so an approval, a finished job or a freed slot is picked\n# up within a minute instead of up to 15. The cost is GitHub API reads, not\n# job slots. Stopgap until approval and close-out wake the next loop directly.\nintervals: { triage: 1m, workers: 1m, reviewers: 1m, merger: 1m }\n\nmerge:\n  # A PR touching any of these waits for a human approval. There is no\n  # built-in list: removing an entry removes its gate. An entry ending in /\n  # is a directory prefix; anything else is a glob (quote globs starting with *).\n  protected_paths:\n    - .github/\n    - .ard/config.yaml\n    - .ard/scanners/\n    - .ard/triage/\n    - .ard/workers/\n    - .ard/reviewers/\n    - \"**/CODEOWNERS\"\n    # Agent instructions a PR could plant to steer later agents.\n    - CLAUDE.md\n    - \"**/CLAUDE.md\"\n    - AGENTS.md\n    - \"**/AGENTS.md\"\n    - .claude/\n    - .mcp.json\n    # What builds, signs and deploys ard itself (docs/proposal.md, Delivery).\n    - \"Jenkinsfile*\"\n    - Dockerfile\n    - .dockerignore\n    - deploy/\n\noverrides:\n  scanners/cve: { every: 6h, max_open: 10, group_size: 1, autoclose: true }\n  # Phase 1 agent roles (the ard init starter set, #39 Gate 2).\n  triage/lead:  { model: claude-opus-5-5, timeout: 15m }\n  triage/engineer: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5 }\n  workers/engineer: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5, timeout: 60m, tests: make lint test }\n  reviewers/eng-review: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5 }\ninternal:\nagent\nagentjob\nbotcheck\nbudget\ncli\ncloseout\ncommitter\nconfig\nconfigcmd\nconfigsrc\ncontroller\ncostblock\ncosts\ndigest\ndocscheck\neffects\nexecutor\ngithub\ngitref\ngitx\ninitcmd\nintake\njanitor\njobexec\njobpod\njobpost\njobpre\nlabels\nlimits\nmerger\nmodelauth\npool\nprgate\nprwatch\nreaper\nredact\nrepopath\nreviewer\nreviewfix\nroles\nscanner\nservecmd\nsetupcmd\nstate\ntarball\ntriage\nversioncheck\nworker\nwtlock\n\ninternal/triage:\ncandidates.go\ndoc.go\nfanin.go\nfanin_test.go\ngate_test.go\nharness_test.go\nintake.go\nintake_test.go\nloop.go\nloop_test.go\norder.go\norder_test.go\npriority_test.go\nrun.go\nsnapshot_test.go\n     202 internal/triage/candidates.go\n      23 internal/triage/doc.go\n     437 internal/triage/fanin.go\n     523 internal/triage/fanin_test.go\n      74 internal/triage/gate_test.go\n     326 internal/triage/harness_test.go\n     301 internal/triage/intake.go\n     356 internal/triage/intake_test.go\n     270 internal/triage/loop.go\n     555 internal/triage/loop_test.go\n      25 internal/triage/order.go\n     128 internal/triage/order_test.go\n      53 internal/triage/priority_test.go\n     169 internal/triage/run.go\n      70 internal/triage/snapshot_test.go\n    3512 total\n(eval):1: no matches found: --include=*.go\nTODO.md\nlayout.md\nproposal.md\nrunbooks\nsite","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8a53bb2c-8dd9-4b7f-a738-479b313d8362","uuid":"c41b69c1-269a-401c-b72a-51c31ceb80a9","timestamp":"2026-11-25T14:16:50.823Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# ard configuration for albertcbrown/ard (dogfooding). Started from `ard init`'s\n# template; human-owned. ard serve reads it from origin/main.\n# Anything unset takes its built-in default (docs/proposal.md, Configuration).\n# Validate with `ard config check`. ard serve reads this file from origin/main.\n\n# label: only issues a maintainer labels for triage enter the pipeline.\n# all: every human-filed issue enters.\nintake: { mode: label }\n\n# Loop poll intervals. Unset loops keep their defaults (scanners 4h,\n# prwatch 5m); 1m is the minimum. Triage, workers, reviewers and the merger\n# poll every minute so an approval, a finished job or a freed slot is picked\n# up within a minute instead of up to 15. The cost is GitHub API reads, not\n# job slots. Stopgap until approval and close-out wake the next loop directly.\nintervals: { triage: 1m, workers: 1m, reviewers: 1m, merger: 1m }\n\nmerge:\n  # A PR touching any of these waits for a human approval. There is no\n  # built-in list: removing an entry removes its gate. An entry ending in /\n  # is a directory prefix; anything else is a glob (quote globs starting with *).\n  protected_paths:\n    - .github/\n    - .ard/config.yaml\n    - .ard/scanners/\n    - .ard/triage/\n    - .ard/workers/\n    - .ard/reviewers/\n    - \"**/CODEOWNERS\"\n    # Agent instructions a PR could plant to steer later agents.\n    - CLAUDE.md\n    - \"**/CLAUDE.md\"\n    - AGENTS.md\n    - \"**/AGENTS.md\"\n    - .claude/\n    - .mcp.json\n    # What builds, signs and deploys ard itself (docs/proposal.md, Delivery).\n    - \"Jenkinsfile*\"\n    - Dockerfile\n    - .dockerignore\n    - deploy/\n\noverrides:\n  scanners/cve: { every: 6h, max_open: 10, group_size: 1, autoclose: true }\n  # Phase 1 agent roles (the ard init starter set, #39 Gate 2).\n  triage/lead:  { model: claude-opus-5-5, timeout: 15m }\n  triage/engineer: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5 }\n  workers/engineer: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5, timeout: 60m, tests: make lint test }\n  reviewers/eng-review: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5 }\ninternal:\nagent\nagentjob\nbotcheck\nbudget\ncli\ncloseout\ncommitter\nconfig\nconfigcmd\nconfigsrc\ncontroller\ncostblock\ncosts\ndigest\ndocscheck\neffects\nexecutor\ngithub\ngitref\ngitx\ninitcmd\nintake\njanitor\njobexec\njobpod\njobpost\njobpre\nlabels\nlimits\nmerger\nmodelauth\npool\nprgate\nprwatch\nreaper\nredact\nrepopath\nreviewer\nreviewfix\nroles\nscanner\nservecmd\nsetupcmd\nstate\ntarball\ntriage\nversioncheck\nworker\nwtlock\n\ninternal/triage:\ncandidates.go\ndoc.go\nfanin.go\nfanin_test.go\ngate_test.go\nharness_test.go\nintake.go\nintake_test.go\nloop.go\nloop_test.go\norder.go\norder_test.go\npriority_test.go\nrun.go\nsnapshot_test.go\n     202 internal/triage/candidates.go\n      23 internal/triage/doc.go\n     437 internal/triage/fanin.go\n     523 internal/triage/fanin_test.go\n      74 internal/triage/gate_test.go\n     326 internal/triage/harness_test.go\n     301 internal/triage/intake.go\n     356 internal/triage/intake_test.go\n     270 internal/triage/loop.go\n     555 internal/triage/loop_test.go\n      25 internal/triage/order.go\n     128 internal/triage/order_test.go\n      53 internal/triage/priority_test.go\n     169 internal/triage/run.go\n      70 internal/triage/snapshot_test.go\n    3512 total\n(eval):1: no matches found: --include=*.go\nTODO.md\nlayout.md\nproposal.md\nrunbooks\nsite","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Gb8Suxw6KBJVXVR6e25S2a","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
